--- Technical ---
### Changed

- Add the M9 frontend redesign to `main` as the v1.9.0 release point. ([#244](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/244))

### Added

- Add citation badges anchored in sanitized assistant Markdown through `AssistantMarkdown.Render(markdown, citations)`. ([#245](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/245))
- Add a primary ticket control that executes the first actionable `SuggestedStep`. ([#237](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/237))
- Add a `CommandPalette` available on every page through Ctrl/Cmd+K. ([#236](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/236))
- Add optimistic ticket status updates with rollback on the board and detail view. ([#235](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/235))
- Remove modal dialogs for ticket status and assignee changes in favor of inline `MudMenu` popovers. ([#234](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/234))
- Add `AnswerCitationLayout` to place citation badges in assistant answers with hover and keyboard-focus previews. ([#233](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/233))
- Add the active agent roster to the chat system prompt using `GetAgentsHandler`. ([#221](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/221))
- Add a forced `check_grounding` `tool_choice` in `AgentLoop` after retrieval and before answer streaming. ([#218](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/218))
- Add `Theme/DesignTokens.cs` as the shared source for palette, spacing, radius, elevation, and semantic chip colors. ([#213](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/213))

### Fixed

- Fix two-line clamping of board card titles by wrapping the title link in `board-card__title-row`. ([#240](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/240))
- Fix the assistant composer send button extending beyond its panel by applying `::deep .assistant-chat` to the panel styles. ([#239](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/239))
- Fix overlap between the ticket queue's Category and Due headers by explicitly sizing the Category column. ([#238](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/238))
- Fix the chat system prompt's write-confirmation policy to prevent unverified success claims and redundant confirmation requests. ([#223](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/223))
- Fix ticket summary timestamps to use `Anthropic:UserTimeZone` before they reach the model. ([#222](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/222))
- Fix `search_knowledge_base` to return `IsError: true` on non-transient failures. ([#220](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/220))
- Fix grounding evaluation of paraphrases and translations by scoring answer sentences with `SemanticGroundingEvaluator`. ([#219](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/219))
