    ! #245: "Citations in Markdown answers: When the assistant quotes a passage title in a Markdown answer, a numbered citation badge appears beside it." - The facts say anchoring depends on the model quoting the passage title verbatim; the wording makes a badge sound guaranteed whenever a title is quoted, without that limitation.

